# LF in the repository, on every platform.
#
# Two files here care about this more than style. `note.ps1` must stay pure
# ASCII and its parser is fussy; and the source-hygiene test asserts on exact
# bytes, so a checkout that silently rewrote line endings would fail a test that
# has nothing to do with line endings and send someone hunting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, whatever the content sniffing thinks.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.tgz binary
